  "limitations": [
    "Only snapshot.11 uses the verified source codec.",
    "Runtime cases are samples, not an exhaustive UI test of every bank, slot, model or group. Same-layout ranges use static corroboration.",
    "General SEND and MON source selectors remain unresolved; named matrix direct inputs are not expanded.",
    "Channel BUS/MAIN/MTX input-side mapping has static corroboration, without a completed UI/SAVE roundtrip.",
    "PRE for CH/AUX is displayed as TAP; do not globally equate it with pre-fader.",
    "Graph reachability is structural; it does not establish audio, cabling, fader/tap behavior, DSP propagation or physical console operation."
